:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Madhead (Enemy)]].''
'''Madhead''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained when beating any stage in [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event#Battle with Madhead!|Battle with Madhead!]] during the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 743
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Madhead
|name2 = Madhead Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Madhead Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Madhead is completely outclassed by [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] in attack rate, recharge time and Weaken uptime, not even accounting for Thaumaturge's [[Talents]]. Madhead's only meaningful advantage is that it doesn't need a [[True Form]] for its Weaken to be guaranteed, which could allow it to help new players with [[Teacher Bun Bun]] or [[Shy Boy]] very early in the game, but as soon as Thaumaturge Cat is unlocked, there is no reason to use Madhead outside of [[Underground Labyrinth]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

